{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99683","id":2198961143,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6DEXv3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99683","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99683.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99683.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99683","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99683/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99683/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99683/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/90b36f8858b381bc2f94099c3029749a1ab04036","number":99683,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Only show reference cross in TextureProgressBar when the node is selected","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This reduces visual obstruction in the editor.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the cross' width no longer scales with zoom, improving visibility at high zoom levels.\r\n\r\nAlternative solution to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99628. This one is simpler - it avoids using an extra internal node which would have a performance cost in scenes with hundreds of TextureProgressBars or more[^1]. It also works more automatically by addressing the original problem at the core (bad visibility when editing pixel art UI), similar to how https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/75303 works.\r\n\r\n[^1]: Even if this is editor-only, it still has an impact when editing scenes in the editor.\r\n\r\nI also have an alternate version where the cross has a drop shadow (not included here), but given it's drawn with thin lines, it doesn't look great at high zoom levels since the lines start being separated from each other.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n#### 100% zoom\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241125_180901](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a80e16f-3513-4949-9a8a-36573e710bb2)\r\n\r\n#### High zoom level (600% or so)\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241125_180906](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eda69769-7458-4059-9070-aa4123527f5b)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui"